' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '50723293-6546-4fe5-a265-32c8f912e421' '--session' '4baf79c5-f271-4a53-b4f1-3eae8dd6dc59' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-14T04:52:48.670Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"50723293-6546-4fe5-a265-32c8f912e421","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"50723293-6546-4fe5-a265-32c8f912e421","session_id":"4baf79c5-f271-4a53-b4f1-3eae8dd6dc59","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"db494c9d-e8da-41a8-a0f1-c3ce663caf83","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"e6fb393e-9021-4e8c-997a-e97ecf21ef4b","thread":"db494c9d-e8da-41a8-a0f1-c3ce663caf83","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-e6fb393e-9021-4e8c-997a-e97ecf21ef4b"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-7g_8103d/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"d0ccf9c769c096bb73808b6c8c317e2351ffb317","card_snapshot_id":"992eab24-f2ae-4102-8195-77ea5b40b83e","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":25,"time":"2026-10-14T04:52:49.855Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"50723293-6546-4fe5-a265-32c8f912e421","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-7g_8103d/repo","cat-file","-t","37949af0926f684724693929d6db642428fc306d"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-7g_8103d/repo"}},{"seq":26,"time":"2026-10-14T04:52:49.861Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"50723293-6546-4fe5-a265-32c8f912e421","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-7g_8103d/repo","cat-file","-t","37949af0926f684724693929d6db642428fc306d"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-